-- Schema v2.0 section 2: "Timestamps are UTC (timestamptz)". init created them as
-- TIMESTAMP(3) WITHOUT TIME ZONE. Prisma has always written UTC into those columns, so each
-- value is reinterpreted explicitly as UTC. Without USING, Postgres would read them in the
-- server's TimeZone setting and shift every stored instant.
-- Generated by `prisma migrate dev --create-only`; the USING clauses were added by hand.

